---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_META } from '../i18n/locales';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About this independent reference guide on search visibility for Hong Kong and Greater Bay Area businesses."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
        <h1>About this guide</h1>
        <p>An independent reference on search engines, generative engine optimization, and AI platform visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
        <h1>關於本指南</h1>
        <p>關於搜尋引擎、生成式引擎優化及 AI 平台可見度的獨立參考資料。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
        <p>
          Search behaviour is changing. Users increasingly rely on AI-generated answers from Google AI Overviews,
          ChatGPT, and Perplexity — not only traditional search results. This guide explains how SEO and GEO
          concepts apply in that environment.
        </p>
        <p>
          Content is written in a neutral, informational tone for business owners, marketers, and operators
          researching how to be found online. It is not affiliated with any single vendor or agency.
        </p>
        <p>
          Topics are updated periodically to reflect changes in AI answers, citation patterns,
          and regional search practices across Hong Kong and the Greater Bay Area.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
        <p>
          搜尋行為正在改變。用戶愈來愈依賴 Google AI Overview、ChatGPT 及 Perplexity 的 AI 生成答案，
          而不只是傳統搜尋結果。本指南說明 SEO 與 GEO 概念在這環境下的應用。
        </p>
        <p>
          內容以中立、資訊性語氣撰寫，供研究如何被找到的業主、營銷人員及營運者參考。
          本指南不隸屬於任何單一供應商或機構。
        </p>
        <p>
          主題會定期更新，以反映 AI 答案、引用模式及香港與大灣區區域搜尋做法的變化。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
